      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the overview. i guess i'm just wondering why certain groups think it should be in the school at all. like, is there a reason why some people think this is something that *needs* to be addressed in class instead of just being something kids learn at home? feels like a big jump to bring it into a school setting.",
