      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see. i guess my worry is that when schools push these specific viewpoints, it kind of undermines the parents' role. if the school is saying \"this is the way things are\" while parents are trying to teach something else, doesn't that just create a lot of unnecessary friction and confusion for the kids? it feels like the school is basically deciding what's \"correct\" for the kids instead of just teaching academic subjects.",
