      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This is a core tension in the debate, often centered on the \"nurture versus nature\" of a child's moral and social development. Opponents argue that the school, in this view, is overextending its role into the personal and ideological \"up to the family,\" leading to a conflict of values for the child. Proponents, however, argue that the school should actively support the *best interest of the whole child* and the reality of the world they will live in, which inherently includes the diverse identities of the community.",
